<title>USA: Galileo gets FDA ok to sell endoscopes.</title>
<headline>Galileo gets FDA ok to sell endoscopes.</headline>
<dateline>STURBRIDGE, Mass. 1996-12-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Galileo Corp said on Friday it got approval from the U.S. Food and Drug Administration to sell its rigid endoscopes in sizes 1.7mm to 10mm in diameter.</p>
<p>The company said endoscopes are miniature telescopes with illumination systems that allow physicians to have direct visualization of internal organs, orifices and canals within the body.</p>
